{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"customer-acquisition-cost-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"customer-acquisition-cost-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["customer-acquisition-cost-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Bilang ng mga gastos at mga customer mula sa parehong panahon at acquisition saklaw. CAC ay isang halo-halong average, hindi bahagyang CAC o katibayan na ang isang kampanya na nagiging sanhi ng bawat benta. Payback gumagamit ng kita × gross margin bilang isang simpleng buwanang gross-profit pagtatantya; ito ay hindi kabilang ang churn, pagbabayad timing, mga buwis, overhead at pagbabago cohorts customer. Hindi pinansiyal na payo.","record_id":"21a071e79bba34e4385762279b61aa5fa62adae7f6cf105c11f37e7f2e5e21f9","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":3.045762333624907,"source":"Count costs and customers from the same period and acquisition scope. CAC is a blended average, not marginal CAC or proof that a campaign caused each sale. Payback uses revenue × gross margin as a simple monthly gross-profit estimate; it excludes churn, payment timing, taxes, overhead and changing customer cohorts. Not financial advice.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"de0b7da85b2dffb15d66079c047738bf004714d2b5d708c63411072962b4c46b","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Bilang ng mga gastos at mga customer mula sa parehong panahon at acquisition saklaw. CAC ay isang halo-halong average, hindi bahagyang CAC o katibayan na ang isang kampanya na nagiging sanhi ng bawat benta. Payback gumagamit ng kita × gross margin bilang isang simpleng buwanang gross-profit pagtatantya; ito ay hindi kabila